# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/transport

## Purpose
Daemon transport implementation module.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `networking` (rank 2; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

